DressCodeQuests = {
  "Red Silk Bandanas^17^14^214^The Deadmines^Alliance^^Scout Riell (Westfall - Sentinel Hill 56, 47)^You can get the Red Silk Bandanas from miners in the Deadmines or the in the town where the instance is located. The quest becomes available after you complete the The Defias Brotherhood questline up to the part where you have to kill Edwin VanCleef.",
  "Collecting Memories^18^14^168^The Deadmines^Alliance^^Wilder Thistlenettle (Stormwind - Dwarven District 65, 21)^The cards drop off undead mobs outside the instance in the area near [3] on the Entrance map.",
  "Oh Brother. . .^20^15^167^The Deadmines^Alliance^^Wilder Thistlenettle (Stormwind - Dwarven District 65,21)^Foreman Thistlenettle is found outside the instance in the undead area at [3] on the Entrance map.",
  "Underground Assault^20^15^2040^The Deadmines^Alliance^^Shoni the Silent (Stormwind - Dwarven District 55,12)^The prequest can be obtained from Gnoarn (Dun Morogh - Gnomeregan Reclamation Facility 24.5,30.4). Sneed's Shredder drops the Sprecklesprocket [3].",
  "The Defias Brotherhood^22^14^166^The Deadmines^Alliance^^Gryan Stoutmantle (Westfall - Sentinel Hill 56,47)^You start this Questline at Gryan Stoutmantle (Westfall - Sentinel Hill 56,47). Edwin VanCleef is the last boss of The Deadmines. You can find him at the top of his ship [6].",
  "The Test of Righteousness^22^20^1654^The Deadmines^Alliance^^Jordan Stilwell (Dun Morogh - Ironforge Entrance 52,36)^Paladin only: To see the note click on [The Test of Righteousness Information].",
  "Captain Grayson's Revenge^22^15^40396^The Deadmines^Alliance^^Captain Grayson (Westfall - Lighthouse 30,86)^You start this Questline on the northwest island in Westfall; Red book on the ground 26.1,16.5).",
  "The Harvest Golem Mystery^19^15^40478^The Deadmines^Alliance^^Maltimor Gartside (Westfall - north from Gold Coast Quarry 31.3,37.6)^You start this Questline at Christopher Hewen (Westfall - Sentinel Hill Inn 52.3,52.8). Questline has 16 quests. Final reward blue items:1) OffHand Int/Shadow res/damage and healing, 2) Mail Shoulders Str/Stam, 3) Leather Gloves Str/Agi/Stam Masterpiece Harvester is at [6].",
  "Turning Off The Tap^20^14^41392^The Deadmines^Alliance^^Renzik 'The Shiv' (Stormwind - Old Town 76, 60)^You start this Questline at the same NPC. Drop from Jared Voss is at [1].",
  "Prototype Thievery^18^16^55005^The Deadmines^Horde^^Wrix Ozzlenut (Durotar - Sparkwater Port 58.3,25.7)^Sneed drops the Prototype Shredder X0-1 Schematic [3].",
  "Captain Grayson's Revenge^22^15^40396^The Deadmines^Horde^^Captain Grayson (Westfall - Lighthouse 30,86)^You start this Quest line on the northwest island in Westfall; Red book on the ground 26.1,16.5).",
  "Horde Defender's Axe^18^15^39998^The Deadmines^Horde^^Birgitte Cranston <Portal Trainer> (Thunder Bluff34.4,20.3)^You start this Questline at Nargal Deatheye (Crossroads 51.2,29.1). This quest JUST TELEPORTS you to WESTFALL. You can either finish this quest and get the reward after completing questline or use it as westfall teleport retaking the quest.",
  "Deviate Hides^17^13^1486^Wailing Caverns^Alliance^^Nalpak (Barrens - Wailing Caverns 47,36)^All deviate mobs inside of and right before the entrance to the instance can drop hides. Nalpak can be found in a hidden cave above the actual cave entrance. Easiest way to him seems to be to run up the hill outside and behind the entrance and drop down the slight ledge above the cave entrance.",
  "Deviate Eradication^21^15^1487^Wailing Caverns^Alliance^^Ebru (Barrens - Wailing Caverns 47,36)^Ebru is in a hidden cave above the cave entrance. Easiest way to him seems to be to run up the hill outside and behind the entrance and drop down the slight ledge above the cave entrance.",
  "The Glowing Shard^26^15^6981^Wailing Caverns^Alliance^^The Glowing Shard (drops from Mutanus the Devourer [9])^Mutanus the Devourer will only appear if you kill the four leader druids of the fang and escort the tauren druid at the entrance. When you have the Shard, you must bring it to the Bank at Ratchet, and then back to the top of the hill over Wailing Caverns to Falla Sagewind.",
  "Serpentbloom^18^16^60125^Wailing Caverns^Alliance^^Alanndarian Nightsong (Auberdine - Darkshore 37.7,40.7)^You get the Serpentbloom inside the cave in front of the instance and inside the instance. Players with Herbalism can see the plants on their minimap.",
  "Trapped in the Nightmare^19^16^60124^Wailing Caverns^Alliance^^Alanndarian Nightsong (Auberdine - Darkshore 37.7,40.7)^Mutanus the Devourer will only appear if you kill the four leader druids of the fang and escort the tauren druid at the entrance.",
  "Rampant Weeds^20^16^41363^Wailing Caverns^Alliance^^Thundris Windweaver (Auberdine - Darkshore 37.4,40.1)^Elementals - Unnatural Overgrowth drop Overgrowth Samples.",
  "Serpentbloom^18^14^962^Wailing Caverns^Horde^^Apothecary Zamah (Thunder Bluff - Spirit Rise 22,20)^Apothecary Zamah is in a cave under the Spirit Rise. You get the prequest from Apothecary Helbrim (Barrens - Crossroads 51,30). You get the Serpentbloom inside the cave in front of the instance and inside the instance. Players with Herbalism can see the plants on their minimap.",
  "Deviate Eradication^21^15^1487^Wailing Caverns^Horde^^Ebru (Barrens - Wailing Caverns 47,36)^Ebru is in a hidden cave above the cave entrance. Easiest way to him seems to be to run up the hill outside and behind the entrance and drop down the slight ledge above the cave entrance.",
  "Leaders of the Fang^22^11^914^Wailing Caverns^Horde^^Nara Wildmane (Thunder Bluff - Elder Rise 75,31)^The Questline starts at Hamuul Runetotem (Thunder Bluff - Elder Rise 78,28) The 4 druids drop the gems [2], [3], [5], [7].",
  "The Glowing Shard^26^15^6981^Wailing Caverns^Horde^^The Glowing Shard (drops from Mutanus the Devourer [9])^Mutanus the Devourer will only appear if you kill the four leader druids of the fang and escort the tauren druid at the entrance. When you have the Shard, you must bring it to the Bank at Ratchet, and then back to the top of the hill over Wailing Caverns to Falla Sagewind.",
  "Arcane Arms^18^14^80312^Wailing Caverns^Horde^Mage^Chok'Garok <Stonemaul Clan> (on a bank of Southfury River in the Barrens 62.4,10.8)^Mage ONLY. The Questline starts at Ureda <Mage Trainer> (Orgrimar) with quest 'Mastering the Arcane'. Moontouched Wood you get from trash, a Crystal of the Serpent from Lord Serpentis <Fanglord>[7], and an Everchanging Essence from Lord Pythas <Fanglord> [5].",
  "Against the Kolkar Dream^23^17^41367^Wailing Caverns^Horde^^Nalpak (Barrens - Wailing Caverns 47,36)^You need to kill Zandara Windhoof [6] and take her head.",
  "The Power to Destroy...^16^9^5725^Ragefire Chasm^Horde^^Varimathras (Undercity - Royal Quarter 56,92)^Searing Blade Cultists and Warlocks drop the books",
  "Searching for the Lost Satchel^16^9^5722^Ragefire Chasm^Horde^^Rahauro (Thunder Bluff - Elder Rise 70,29)^You find Maur Grimtotem at [1]. After getting the satchel you must bring it back to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff",
  "Hidden Enemies^16^9^5728^Ragefire Chasm^Horde^^Thrall (Orgrimmar - Valley of Wisdom 31,37)^You find Bazzalan at [4] and Jergosh at [3]. The questline starts at Warchief Thrall in Orgrimmar.",
  "The Lost Tablets of Will^45^35^1139^Uldaman^Alliance^^Advisor Belgrum (Ironforge - Hall of Explorers 77,10)^The tablet is at [8].",
  "Power Stones^36^30^2418^Uldaman^Alliance^^Rigglefuzz (Badlands 42,52)^The stones can be found on any Shadowforge enemies before and in the instance.",
  "Agmond's Fate^38^30^704^Uldaman^Alliance^^Prospector Ironband (Loch Modan - Ironband's Excavation Site 65,65)^The Prequest starts at Prospector Stormpike (Ironforge - Hall of Explorers 74,12). The Urns are scattered throughout the caves before the instance.",
  "Solution to Doom^40^30^709^Uldaman^Alliance^^Theldurin the Lost (Badlands 51,76)^The tablet is north of the caves, at the east end of a tunnel, before the instance. On the Entrance map, it's at [3].",
  "The Hidden Chamber^40^35^2240^Uldaman^Alliance^^Baelog (Uldaman [1])^The Hidden Chamber is at [4]. To open the Hidden Chamber you need The Shaft of Tsol from Revelosh [3] and the Gni'kiv Medallion from Baelog's Chest [1]. Combine these two items to form Staff of Prehistoria. The Staff is used in the Map Room between [3] and [4] to summon Ironaya. After killing her, run inside the room she came from to get quest credit.",
  "Restoring the Necklace^44^37^2204^Uldaman^Alliance^^Talvash's Scrying Bowl^The Shattered Necklace Power Source drops Archaedas [10].",
  "Uldaman Reagent Run^42^36^17^Uldaman^Alliance^^Ghak Healtouch (Loch Modan - Thelsamar 37,49)^The caps are scattered throughout the instance. Herbalists can see them on their minimap if Track Herbs is on and they have the quest.",
  "The Platinum Discs^47^40^2278^Uldaman^Alliance^^The Discs of Norgannon (Uldaman [11])^After you receive the quest, speak to the stone watcher to the left of the discs. Then use the platinum discs again to recieve miniature discs, which you'll have to take to High Explorer Magellas in Ironforge - Hall of Explorers (69,18). The followup starts another NPC who is nearby.",
  "Stealing a Core^45^45^40129^Uldaman^Alliance^^Torble Sparksprocket (The Barrens 48.6,83 gnome with purple goggles under the tent, next to the dwarf)^Intact Power Core [11], in the room with platinum disc behind the last boss in the chest behind the right pillar. Questline starts in Southern Barrens -> Bael Modan -> a little north from the path to Bael'dun Keep under the tent. First quest can be attain at lvl 18, last at lvl 53",
  "Power Stones^36^30^2418^Uldaman^Horde^^Rigglefuzz (Badlands 42,52)^The stones can be found on any Shadowforge enemies before and in the instance.",
  "Solution to Doom^40^30^709^Uldaman^Horde^^Theldurin the Lost (Badlands 51,76)^The tablet is north of the caves, at the east end of a tunnel, before the instance. On the Entrance map, it's at [3].",
  "Find the Gems and Power Source^44^37^2339^Uldaman^Horde^^Jarkal Mossmeld (Badlands - Kargath 2,46)^The gems are at [1] in a Conspicous Urn, [8] from the Shadowforge Cache, and [9] off Grimlok. Note that when openning the Shadowforge Cache, a few mobs will spawn an aggro you. The Shattered Necklace Power Source drops from Archaedas [10].",
  "Uldaman Reagent Run^42^36^2202^Uldaman^Horde^^Jarkal Mossmeld (Badlands - Kargath 2,69)^You get the Prequest from Jarkal Mossmeld, too. The caps are scattered throughout the instance. Herbalists can see them on their minimap if Track Herbs is on and they have the quest.",
  "Requisitioning a Core^45^45^40131^Uldaman^Horde^^Kex Blowmaster (The Barrens 45.7,83.6 goblin under the tent.^Intact Power Core [11], in the room with platinum disc behind the last boss in the chest behind the right pillar. Questline starts in Southern Barrens -> Bael Modan -> west side of the road to The Thousand Needles, accros Bael Modan Excavation. first quest can be taken at lvl 18. last at lvl 53.",
  "Dark Iron Legacy^52^48^3802^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Franclorn Forgewright (Blackrock Mountain [3] on Entrance map)^Franclorn is in the middle of the blackrock, above his grave. You have to be dead to see him! Talk 2 times with him to start the quest. Fineous Darkvire is at [9]. You find the Shrine next to the arena [7].",
  "Ribbly Screwspigot^53^48^4136^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Yuka Screwspigot (Burning Steppes - Flame Crest 65,22)^You get the prequest from Yorba Screwspigot (Tanaris - Steamwheedle Port 67,23). Ribbly is at [15].",
  "The Love Potion^54^50^4201^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Mistress Nagmara (Blackrock Depths [15])^You get the Giant Silver Veins from Giants in Azshara. Gromsblood can be most easily acquired from either an herbalist or at the Auction House. Lastly, the vial can be filled at the Go-Lakka crater (Un'Goro Crater 31,50). After completing the quest, you can use the backdoor instead of killing Phalanx.",
  "Hurley Blackbreath^55^50^4126^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Ragnar Thunderbrew (Dun Morogh - Kharanos 46,52)^You get the prequest from Enohar Thunderbrew (Blasted Lands - Nethergarde Keep 61,18). You get the recipe from one of the guards who appear if you destroy the ale [15].",
  "Incendius!^56^48^4263^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Jalinda Sprig (Burning Steppes - Morgan's Vigil 85,69)^You get the prequest from Jalinda Sprig, too. You find Lord Incendius at [10].",
  "The Good Stuff^56^50^4286^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Oralius (Burning Steppes - Morgan's Vigil 84,68)^All dwarves can drop the packs.",
  "Marshal Windsor^54^48^4241^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Marshal Maxwell (Burning Steppes - Morgan's Vigil 84,68)^This is part of the Onyxia attunement questline. It starts at Helendis Riverhorn (Burning Steppes - Morgan's Vigil 85,68). Marshal Windsor is at [4]. You have to come back to Maxwell after completing this quest.",
  "Jail Break!^58^50^4322^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Marshal Windsor (Blackrock Depths [4])^This is part of the Onyxia attunement questline. Marshal Windsor is at [4]. The quest is easier if you clean the Ring of Law ([6]) and the path to the entrance before you start the event. You find Marshal Maxwell at Burning Steppes - Morgan's Vigil (84,68)",
  "A Taste of Flame^58^52^4024^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Cyrus Therepentous (Burning Steppes 94,31)^The questline starts at Kalaran Windblade (Searing Gorge 39,38). Bael'Gar is at [11].",
  "The Fate of the Kingdom^59^50^4362^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^King Magni Bronzebeard (Ironforge 39,55)^Princess Moira Bronzebeard is at [21]. During the fight she might heal Dagran. Try to interrupt her as often as possible, but hurry as she must not die or you can't complete the quest! After talking to her you have to return to Magni Bronzebeard.",
  "Operation Help Jabbey^58^50^40757^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Jabbey (Tanaris, Steamwheedle Port 67,24)^Questline starts at Bixxle Screwfuse (Tel'Abim 52,34). Drop from Darneg Darkbeard. Rewards from Operation Final Repairs(Necks) quest and the final quest - The Dark Iron Desecrator(Gun).",
  "The Dark Iron Desecrator^60^55^40762^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Bixxle Screwfuse (Tel'Abim Island east from Tanaris)^This quest requires to collect 4 items. 1) Magma Condensor (Blackrock Depths in Magma Condensor Crate) 2) Intricate Arcanite Barrel (Blackrock Spire in Intricate Arcanite Barrels container) 3) Molten Fragment (Molten Core from Molten Destroyer). 4) Dark Iron Rifle (crafted by Engineers). To finish the construction, I will also need Fiery Core(x3) found in Molten Core, and Enchanted Thorium Bars(x10).",
  "Senatorial Revenge^56^45^40464^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Orvak Sternrock (after Redridge Mountains - Burning Steppes pass 76,68, west from alliance camp)^This questline starts at Radgan Deepblaze next to Orvak Sternrock with quest 'Gaining Orvak's Trust'",
  "The Arcane Golem Core^55^45^40467^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Radgan Deepblaze (after Redridge Mountains - Burning Steppes pass 76,68, west from alliance camp)^This questline starts at Radgan Deepblaze next to Orvak Sternrock with quest 'Gaining Orvak's Trust'",
  "To Build a Pounder^60^30^80401^Blackrock Depths^Alliance^^Oglethorpe Obnoticus <Master Gnome Engineer> (Stranglethorn Vale; Booty Bay 28.4,76.3).^(Engineers only)This quest requires to collect 3 items. 1) Thorium Tuned Servo (Scarlet Monastery from Scarlet Myrmidon) 2) Perfect Golem Core (Blackrock Depths from Golem Lord Argelmach) 3) Adamantite Rod (Stratholme from Crimson Hammersmith) 'Crowd Pummeler 9-60' in Gnomeregan drops 'Intact Pounder Mainframe' that starts the PreQuest 'A Pounding Brain'.",
  "Lost Thunderbrew Recipe^55^50^4134^Blackrock Depths^Horde^^Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave (Badlands - Kargath 2,47)^You get the prequest from Apothecary Zinge in Undercity - The Apothecarium (50,68). You get the recipe from one of the guards who appear if you destroy the ale [15].",
  "Operation: Death to Angerforge^58^52^4132^Blackrock Depths^Horde^^Warlord Goretooth (Badlands - Kargath 5,47)^You find General Angerforge at [13]. He calls help below 30%! Questline starts at Lexlort(Badlands - Kargath, on the tower) with quest 'Grark Lorkrub'.",
  "The Rise of the Machines^58^52^4063^Blackrock Depths^Horde^^Lotwil Veriatus (Badlands 25,44)^You get the prequest from Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania (Badlands - Kargath 3,47). You find Argelmach at [14].",
  "A Taste of Flame^58^52^4024^Blackrock Depths^Horde^^Cyrus Therepentous (Burning Steppes 94,31)^The questline starts at Kalaran Windblade (Searing Gorge 39,38). Bael'Gar is at [11].",
  "Disharmony of Fire^56^48^3907^Blackrock Depths^Horde^^Thunderheart (Badlands - Kargath 3,48)^You get the prequest from Thunderheart, too. You find Lord Incendius at [10].",
  "The Last Element^54^48^7201^Blackrock Depths^Horde^^Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave (Badlands - Kargath 2,47)^You get the prequest from Thunderheart (Badlands - Kargath 3,48). Every elemental can drop the Essence",
  "The Royal Rescue^59^48^4003^Blackrock Depths^Horde^^Thrall (Orgrimmar 31,37)^After talking a with Kharan Mighthammer and Thrall you get this quest. You find Emperor Dagran Thaurissan at [21]. The Princess heals Dagran but you must not kill her to complete the quest! Try to interrupt her healing spells. (Rewards are for The Princess Saved?)",
  "Nefarius's Corruption^60^60^8730^Blackwing Lair^Alliance^^Vaelastrasz the Corrupt (Blackwing Lair [2])^Only one person can loot the Shard. Anachronos (Tanaris - Caverns of Time 65,49)",
  "The Lord of Blackrock^60^60^7781^Blackwing Lair^Alliance^^Head of Nefarian (drops from Nefarian [9])^Highlord Bolvar Fordragon is at (Stormwind City - Stormwind Keep 78,20). The follow up sends you to Field Marshal Afrasiabi (Stormwind - Valley of Heroes 67,72) for the reward.",
  "The Only Prescription^60^60^8620^Blackwing Lair^Alliance^^Narain Soothfancy (Tanaris 65,18)^Chapter can be looted by multiple people. Draconic for Dummies (looted from a table [2'])",
  "The Key to Karazhan IX^60^58^40828^Blackwing Lair^Alliance^^Dolvan Bracewind (Dustwallow Marsh - Westhaven Hollow 71,73)^Prequest - Lord Ebonlocke (Lower Karazhan Halls). Book 'Treatise on Magical Locks and Keys' is in the last boss room [9], next to the throne. Reward from the next quest.",
  "Knowledge in the Deeps^23^10^971^Blackfathom Deeps^Alliance^^Gerrig Bonegrip (Ironforge - The Forlorn Cavern 50,5)^You find the Manuscript at [2] in the water.",
  "Researching the Corruption^24^18^1275^Blackfathom Deeps^Alliance^^Gershala Nightwhisper (Darkshore - Auberdine 38,43)^You get it from Argos Nightwhisper at (Stormwind - The Park 21,55). All the Nagas before and in Blackfathom Deeps drop the brains.",
  "Blackfathom Villainy^27^18^1200^Blackfathom Deeps^Alliance^^Argent Guard Thaelrid (Blackfathom Deeps [4])^Twilight Lord Kelris is at [8]. You find Dawnwatcher Selgorm in Darnassus - Craftsmen's Terrace (55,24). ATTENTION! If you turn on the flames beside Lord Kelris, enemies appear and attack you.",
  "Twilight Falls^25^20^1199^Blackfathom Deeps^Alliance^^Argent Guard Manados (Darnassus - Craftsmen's Terrace 55,23)^Every Twilight mob can drop the pendants.",
  "The Orb of Soran'ruk^25^20^1740^Blackfathom Deeps^Alliance^^Doan Karhan (Barrens 49,57)^Warlock only: You get the 3 Soran'ruk Fragments from Twilight Accolytes in [Blackfathom Deeps]. You get the Large Soran'ruk Fragment in [Shadowfang Keep] from Shadowfang Darksouls.",
