  "Bijou's Belongings^59^55^4982^Blackrock Spire Lower^Horde^^Bijou (Blackrock Spire [3])^You find Bijou's Belongings on the way to Mother Smolderweb at [13]. The Rewards belong to 'Bijou's Reconnaissance Report'.",
