  "Libram of Focus^60^58^7479^Dire Maul West^Alliance^^Lorekeeper Lydros (Dire Maul - West or North [1] Library)^It's not a prequest, but Elven Legends must be completed before this quest can be started. The Libram is a random drop in Dire Maul and is tradeable, so it may be found on the Auction House. Skin of Shadow is Soulbound and can drop off some bosses, Risen Constructs and Risen Bonewarder in Scholomance.",
  "Libram of Protection^60^58^7485^Dire Maul West^Alliance^^Lorekeeper Lydros (Dire Maul - West or North [1] Library)^It's not a prequest, but Elven Legends must be completed before this quest can be started. The Libram is a random drop in Dire Maul and is tradeable, so it may be found on the Auction House. Frayed Abomination Stitching is Soulbound and can drop off Ramstein the Gorger, Venom Belchers, Bile Spewer and Patchwork Horror in Stratholme.",
  "Libram of Rapidity^60^58^7483^Dire Maul West^Alliance^^Lorekeeper Lydros (Dire Maul - West or North [1] Library)^It's not a prequest, but Elven Legends must be completed before this quest can be started. The Libram is a random drop in Dire Maul and is tradeable, so it may be found on the Auction House. Blood of Heroes is Soulbound and can be found on the ground in random places in the Western and Eastern Plaguelands.",
