  "Into the Dream III^60^58^40959^Dire Maul West^Alliance^^Ralathius (Hyjal - Nordanaar [81.6,27.7] a green dragonkin)^Arcane Torrents big elementals in the circle around [6] drop Overloaded Arcane Prism. Finishing this questline you get the necklace and you will be able to enter Hyjal raid instance Emerald Sanctum.",
