  "Undoing Draconic Presence^47^35^40943^Gilneas City^Alliance^^Magus Orelius <Kirin Tor> (Gilneas - Ravenshire (main building) 57.7,68.5)^Bring 1 Large Glowing Shard you will need 1 for prequest. enchanters have them or auction house can help. it should be cheap.",
  "The Fall and Rise of Greymane^42^35^40956^Gilneas City^Alliance^^Lord Darius Ravenwood (Gilneas - Ravenshire (main building) 58.4,67.6)^Quest line starts with quest 'Wolf Amongst Sheep' at Baron Caliban Silverlaine (Gilneas - Ravenshire (main building) 58.4,67.8) The Greymane Crown drops from Genn Greymane [8], last boss on the top of the tower.",
  "Manuscript on Hydromancy II^45^38^41114^Gilneas City^Alliance^Mage^Magus Hallister (Dustwallow Marsh - Theramore, central Tower)^(Mage ONLY) Mage Theramore teleport quest. the Manuscript on Hydromancy II in the building [b], go right, on the dresser (south side).",
  "Left In Bad Faith^44^40^41285^Gilneas City^Alliance^^Talvash del Kissel (Ironforge - The Mystic Ward 36,3).^(Jewelcrafter: Goldsmith ONLY) Prequest from Mayva Togview (Ironforge - Hall of Explorers 60,24). Dustivan Blackcowl [4] drops the Tarnished Citrine Choker",
  "Ebonmere Affairs^45^35^40979^Gilneas City^Horde^^Joshua Ebonmere (Gilneas - Ebonmere Farm [49.5,31.1]). Entering Gilneas gates follow the mountain on your left(east), in the field with windmills you will find Joshua Ebonmere.^Prequest 'Ebonmere Bat Infestation' and 'Ebonmere Worgen Infestation'. Dustivan Blackcowl [4] drops the Ebonmere Deed",
  "The Evil Made Me Do It^46^35^40881^Gilneas City^Horde^^Orvan Darkeye (Gilneas - ruins of Greyshire [31.3,47.0])^Questline starts at Deathstalker Alynna (Gilneas Stillward Church [57.3,39.6], inside) with quest 'Dead Until Dark'. 'On the Powers of Blood' book on the table behind Regent-Lady Celia Harlow and Regent-Lord Mortimer Harlow, next to the Harlow Family Chest[7]. You will get the reward finishing the next quest.",
  "Genn Greymane Must Die!^49^40^40849^Gilneas City^Horde^^Blackthorn (Gilneas - Blackthorn's Camp [14.1,33.7], camp at northwest corner shore.)^2 Questlines need to be finished to start this quest 'Report to Luke Agamand' and 'Report to Livia Strongarm' at Blackthorn.",
  "The Greymane Stone^47^38^40996^Gilneas City^Horde^^Dark Bishop Mordren (Gilneas - Stillward Church 57.7,39.6)^Questline starts with quest 'Through Greater Magic' at Dark Bishop Mordren. Shard of Midnight is behind the last boss Genn Greymane [8] You will get the reward finishing the next quest.",
  "Foreign Knowledge^44^34^41289^Gilneas City^Horde^^Jarkal Mossmeld (Badlands - Kargath 2,46).^(Jewelcrafter: Goldsmith only) Prequest from Gulmire Fartower (Undercity - The Rogue Quarter 77,76). 'Gilnean Jewelry: A Compendium' (where?) contain item.Mastering Goldsmithing",
  "Le Fishe Au Chocolat^60^55^41004^Lower Karazhan^Alliance^^Doorman Montigue at the beginning of the dungeon in front of the stairs.^Bring the Charge of Karazhan to The Cook near[e] in Lower Karazhan Halls.",
  "Contribution to the Church^60^55^41078^Lower Karazhan^Alliance^^Heirophant Nerseus (Deadwind Pass, in front of the church next to Karazhan [40.3,77.2]).^15x Arcane Essence - random trash loot; 20x Illusion Dust - Enchanters or Auction House; 10x Greater Eternal Essence - Enchanters or Auction House; After finishing this quest you will be able to get a quest for head/leg enchants. For each of them you will need: 1x Overcharged Ley Energy - random rare item loot from trash/boss in Karazhan; 6x Arcane Essence - random trash loot.",
  "Comically Large Candle^61^60^41344^Lower Karazhan^Alliance^^Doorman Montigue at the beginning of the dungeon in front of the stairs.^Mage only: Grizikil [3] drops 'Comically Large Candle'. The quest line starts from Big Whiskers in [Tower of Karazhan].",
  "Smoldering Dream Essence^60^55^40905^Emerald Sanctum^Alliance^^Smoldering Dream Essence [2]^Druid only: Arch Druid Dreamwind is at (Hyjal - Nordanaar 85,30). Only one person in the raid can loot this item and the quest can only be done one time. Rewards listed are for the followup.",
  "Head of Solnius^60^58^40963^Emerald Sanctum^Alliance^^Head of Solnius [2]^Ralathius is at (Hyjal - Nordanaar 85,30). Only one person in the raid can loot this item and the quest can only be done one time.",
  "The Claw of Erennius^60^55^41038^Emerald Sanctum^Alliance^^Claw of Erennius [1]^Ralathius is at (Hyjal - Nordanaar 85,30). Only one person in the raid can loot this item and the quest can only be done one time.",
  "The Rift Calls^60^60^42005^Emerald Sanctum^Alliance^^Altar of Depths (Azshara [89, 56]).^Warlocks only!Prequest starts from 'Mass of Writhing Tentacles' drops from (Timbermaw Hold [10]). 'Solnius' is at [2].",
  "The Scepter Rod of Medivh^60^60^41369^Towerof Karazhan^Alliance^^Anelace the Clairvoyant (Deadwind Pass - Morgan's Plot 41.2,79.2)^Obsidian Rod Lower Karazhan Halls [e]. Cosmic Residue drop from [3]. The Binding of Xanthar prequest start at the Hanvar the Righteous (Deadwind Pass - Morgan's Plot 40.9, 79.3), Wine for Kyleson prequest start at the The Cook (Lower Karazhan Halls [e])",
  "Tirisfal's Vestige^60^60^41370^Towerof Karazhan^Alliance^^Anelace the Clairvoyant (Deadwind Pass - Morgan's Plot 41.2,79.2)^Drop from Echo of Medivh [4]. Khadgar's Journal [?] start this quest chain. Reward from the last quest in quest chain. Sanv K'la (Swamp of Sorrows 25, 30) start The Sanv Charm quest chain.",
