  "Pedestal of Unity^30^25^41774^Dragonmaw Retreat^Alliance^^Pedestal of Unity (Dragonmaw Retreat 35,93)^Pedestal near [5] 'Fragment of Algoron' drops from [3] 'Fragment of Dathronag' contains in 'Chest of Dathronag' [a]",
