  "Unbridled Darkness^60^60^41933^Timbermaw Hold^Alliance^^Narkogg the Dark (Azshara - Maw of Ursoc 39, 21)^'Narkogg’s Medicine Pouch' and 'Putrid Flower' are at Timbermaw Hold.",
  "Essence of Purification^60^60^42021^Timbermaw Hold^Alliance^^Narkogg the Dark (Azshara - Maw of Ursoc 39, 21)^You need to bring 1x 'Timbermaw Sap', 2x 'Essence of Earth' and 2x 'Living Essence' to Narkogg the Dark.",
