  "Nefarius's Corruption^60^60^8730^Blackwing Lair^Horde^^Vaelastrasz the Corrupt (Blackwing Lair [2])^Only one person can loot the Shard. Anachronos (Tanaris - Caverns of Time 65,49)",
  "The Moonshrine Ruins^26^18^41812^Blackfathom Deeps^Horde^^Aelennia Starbloom (Ashenvale 17,26)^'Seed of Bloom' are located under the tree next to [4]",
  "Urok Doomhowl^60^55^4867^Blackrock Spire Lower^Horde^^Warosh (Blackrock Spire [2])^To get Warosh's Mojo you have to evoke and kill Urok Doomhowl [15]. For his Evocation you need a Spear and Highlord Omokk's Head [5]. The Spear is at [3]. During the Evocation a few waves of ogres appear before Urok Doomhowl attacks you. You can use the Spear during the fight to damage the ogres.",
  "Mea Culpa, Lord Valthalak^60^58^8995^Blackrock Spire Upper^Horde^^Bodley (Blackrock Mountain [D] on Entrance Map)^Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer is needed to see Bodley. You get it from the 'In Search of Anthion' quest. Lord Valthalak is summoned at [8]. Rewards listed are for Return to Bodley.",
  "The Demon Forge^60^55^5127^Blackrock Spire Upper^Horde^^Lorax (Winterspring 64,74)^Blacksmith quest. Goraluk Anvilcrack is at [5].",
  "The Upper Binding I^60^55^41011^Blackrock Spire Upper^Horde^^Parnabus <Wandering Wizard> (Gilneas [22.9,74.4], very south of Gilneas City, west of river. inside of a lonely house).^Highly recommend to take prequest 'The Binding of Xanthar' from Hanvar the Righteous (Deadwind Pass in the small church outside of Karazhan [40.9,79.3]). Reward for the last quest of The Upper Binding quest chain will be quest item 'The Upper Binding of Xanthar' for quest 'The Binding of Xanthar'.",
  "Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin^58^54^7441^Dire Maul East^Horde^^Azj'Tordin (Feralas - Lariss Pavillion 76,37)^Pusillin is in Dire Maul East at [1]. He runs when you talk to him, but stops and fights at [2]. He'll drop the Crescent Key which is used for Dire Maul North and West.",
  "The Forging of Quel'Serrar^60^60^7509^Onyxias Lair^Horde^^Lorekeeper Lydros (Dire Maul - West or North [1] Library)^Drop the Sword in front of Onyxia when she's at 10% to 15% health. She'll have to breathe on and heat it. When Onyxia dies, pick the sword back up, click her corpse and use the sword. Then you're ready to turn in the quest.",
  "The Only Prescription^60^60^8620^Onyxias Lair^Horde^^Narain Soothfancy (Tanaris 65, 18)Draconic for Dummies (drops from Onyxia [3])^Only one person can loot the Chapter. Draconic for Dummies VI (drops from Onyxia [3])",
  "Blueleaf Tubers^26^20^1221^Razorfen Kraul^Horde^^Mebok Mizzyrix (The Barrens - Ratchet 62,37)^The Crate, the Stick and the Manual can all be found near Mebok Mizzyrix.",
  "In the Name of the Light^40^34^1053^Scarlet Monastery Armory^Alliance^^Raleigh the Devout (Hillsbrad Foothills - Southshore 51,58)^This quest line starts at Brother Crowley with quest 'Brother Anton' in Stormwind - Cathedral of Light (42,24). You can find High Inquisitor Whitemane and Scarlet Commander Mograine at SM: Cathedral [2], Herod at SM: Armory [1] and Houndmaster Loksey at SM: Library [1].",
  "Into The Scarlet Monastery^42^33^1048^Scarlet Monastery Armory^Horde^^Varimathras (Undercity - Royal Quarter 56,92)^You can find High Inquisitor Whitemane and Scarlet Commander Mograine at SM: Cathedral [2], Herod at SM: Armory [1] and Houndmaster Loksey at SM: Library [1].",
  "In the Name of the Light^40^34^1053^Scarlet Monastery Cathedral^Alliance^^Raleigh the Devout (Hillsbrad Foothills - Southshore 51,58)^This quest line starts at Brother Crowley with quest 'Brother Anton' in Stormwind - Cathedral of Light (42,24). You can find High Inquisitor Whitemane and Scarlet Commander Mograine at SM: Cathedral [2], Herod at SM: Armory [1] and Houndmaster Loksey at SM: Library [1].",
  "Into The Scarlet Monastery^42^33^1048^Scarlet Monastery Cathedral^Horde^^Varimathras (Undercity - Royal Quarter 56,92)^You can find High Inquisitor Whitemane and Scarlet Commander Mograine at SM: Cathedral [2], Herod at SM: Armory [1] and Houndmaster Loksey at SM: Library [1].",
  "To Wake The Ashbringer^60^60^20002^Stratholme^Horde^^Tirion Fordring (Western Plaguelands - Light's Hope Chapel 67.3,24.2).^Tabard of the Ashbringer drops from Grand Crusader Dathrohan [11], Cape of Alexandros drops from Baron Rivendare[19] Questline starts in Naxxramas after killing 4 Horsemans with quest 'Orb of Pure Light'",
  "C'Thun's Legacy^60^60^8801^The Templeof Ahn Qiraj^Horde^^Eye of C'Thun (drops from C'Thun [9])^Caelestrasz (Temple of Ahn'Qiraj 2') Rewards listed are for the followup.",
  "The Unwise Elders^34^26^40090^The Crescent Grove^Horde^^Grol the Exile (Ashenvale 56,59)^Drop from furbolgs near first boss.",
  "No Honor Among Chefs^61^60^41374^Karazhan Crypt^Horde^^The Cook near ([Lower Karazhan Halls- e])^Drop from [Ravenous Strigoi]. The quest line starts [Recipes of Kezan] get in [Tower of Karazhan].",
  "The Judge and the Phantom^46^35^40975^Gilneas City^Horde^^Angered Phantom (Gilneas -Glaymore Stead 52.9,27.9)^You can find Angered Phantom inside building on the mountain. Entering Gilneas gates follow the mountain on your left(east), passing a field with windmills you will find a path to the sea, almost at the edge turn north follow the path(barely noticable).",
